            <ArticleTitle>For Physician Executive Posts, What's in a Name?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>22-23</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Medical directors have been around for a long time. Today, to reflect expanding duties, there's a bewildering array of other titles too. Are we all agreed on what titles mean, then? No way. For example: Many executives who are called CMOs - or something else - are also taking on the new duties of value-based care.</AbstractText>
